<title>JAPAN: Nippon Crane - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Crane - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to April 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
